# {{title}}

A package for the Flux framework. Flux runs `lib/sh_{{id}}.lua` on the server and the clients
of every project that depends on `{{id}}`, with `{{global}}` as the global of the package.

## Development

To work on the package from a schema, link this checkout into the schema, declare the
dependency and install:

```sh
cd <path to the schema>
fpkg link <path to this checkout>
fpkg add {{id}}
```

`fpkg add` writes `s.depends('{{id}}', ...)` into the schema's `packagespec.lua`, locks and
installs. Changes to this checkout are then live in the schema.

Validate the specification and see what a release contains:

```sh
fpkg check
fpkg pack --list
```

## Publishing

Raise `s.version`, log in once with `fpkg login`, then run `fpkg publish`.
